 declared GET item handler is read_item and receives current_user at handler entry.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-153f719b7cb901c9","startLine":48,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"Within the supplied handler source, authorization decisions use the current_user parameter; the crop does not establish how the upstream CurrentUser binding supplies it.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-153f719b7cb901c9","startLine":49,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The requested item is loaded by ID from the session before the authorization check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-153f719b7cb901c9","startLine":53,"endLine":53}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"Cross-owner access is denied only when current_user.is_superuser is false and item.owner_id differs from current_user.id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-153f719b7cb901c9","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"Under the task premise, current_user.is_superuser is true, so the visible cross-owner denial condition is not satisfied.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-153f719b7cb901c9","startLine":56,"endLine":56}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"When the item exists and the denial condition is not triggered, the handler returns the item.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-153f719b7cb901c9","startLine":53,"endLine":58}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2320,"output":833,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":33910.4819,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T17:59:59.904Z"}}
